OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity care probe team to meet
OL,4,Awith families
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bereaved mother is hoping a maternity
OL,7,Fand neonatal care review into her local
OL,8,FNHS trust will help gain answers about
OL,9,Fthe loss of her baby.
OL,11,FBeth Cooper said she felt dismissed by
OL,12,Fstaff at the Princess Royal Hospital in
OL,13,FHaywards Heath, West Sussex, when she
OL,14,Frepeatedly expressed concerns about her
OL,15,Funborn son Felix in the lead up to his
OL,16,Fdeath at 34 weeks.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
