OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity care probe team to meet
OL,4,Awith families
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 31-year-old has described sessions
OL,7,Fbeing held on Saturday between bereaved
OL,8,Fparents and investigators involved with
OL,9,Fthe review into University Hospitals
OL,10,FSussex NHS Foundation Trust (UHSussex)
OL,11,Fas a "massive" moment.
OL,13,FUHSussex said it was unable to comment
OL,14,Fon specific cases but that it "fully
OL,15,Fsupports the review process".
